  "ingredients": [
    "4 medium potatoes, peeled and halved",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour, plus extra for dusting",
    "1 tablespoon melted butter",
    "1 pinch salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Zneiw-g-gYNnWD82QZFgWDP_sR8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-100506-IrishPotatoFarls-ddmfs-step1-3x4-6934-4816e9c8051c459e97b7a3cda7e0ae6e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/100506/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover potatoes with water in a pot and bring to a boil over high heat. Simmer on medium-high heat until center of potatoes are tender when pricked with a fork, about 20 minutes. Turn off heat. Drain, return potatoes to the pot, and allow to completely dry out over the remaining residual heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZB_RmMZqU60Kec-DWGSkdpPwNjo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-100506-IrishPotatoFarls-ddmfs-step2-3x4-69421-b5ef47c4e47c48afa130a439367ef256.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/100506/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash with a potato masher until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uoiLyy12DbfW8MqZcSNKYfWwMe8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-100506-IrishPotatoFarls-ddmfs-step3-3x4-6964-2e389b6522864877accfac557179140e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/100506/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place warm mashed potato in a medium bowl. Stir in flour, melted butter, and salt. Mix lightly until dough forms.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6TgKMs3QbdwrBg2AyfSU_Zr5Sr8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-100506-IrishPotatoFarls-ddmfs-step4-3x4-6973-e0f4003a27e444f486d6a1107eb47681.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/100506/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead dough lightly on a well-floured surface. The dough will be sticky. Use a floured rolling pin to flatten into a 9-inch circle about 1/4 inch thick. Cut into quarters using a floured knife.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rbJu1BWnlwUsVOQuylB1_phvs9Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-100506-IrishPotatoFarls-ddmfs-step6-3x4-6977-18f9f51a0f9342d89093a5f694aeda5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/100506/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle a little flour into the bottom of a skillet and cook farls until evenly browned, about 3 minutes on each side. Season with a little salt and serve straight away.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DBED1_YrHziHpEqGN8I8o8zINVY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-100506-IrishPotatoFarls-ddmfs-step8-3x4-6995-752bec425b9e4a29acf3e73daa81c50c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/100506/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
